# playpick: mode=raid boss=saved spec=druid:restoration style=auto size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# The One You Save has had six prior sessions on direction.md's line-1 and
# elsewhere, but every one of them reached it through mode=daily or
# mode=walk, and none of them was a healer spec -- this is the first direct
# mode=raid pull of it, the first restoration druid this job has ever
# played, and the first time a healer spec has met the one fight on the
# roster whose entire victory condition is a bar going up rather than a
# boss's health going down (src/sim/encounters.ts's own comment: "the
# victory condition itself had to become a parameter"). style=auto also
# means the player steers nowhere and presses nothing once the toggle is
# on (scripts/playbot.ts's acting==='auto' branch has no movement case and
# is absent from both the mash/wander and good/melee/learn ability
# branches) -- so this reads what the game's own autocast does with a
# healing kit on a fight that is itself about healing, completely hands
# off.
open #b=saved&s=25&h=1
targets
ui
tap class:druid:restoration
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot saved-open

play auto 100
bill
says
state
shot saved-mid

play auto 100
bill
says
state
shot saved-end
